{"data": {"event": {"id": "e75449b5-4e53-41a1-9f17-85024ea222dc", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ances de cours", "sessionTypeColor": "#6545fa", "voting": null, "title": "Cancers de Primitif Inconnu (CAPI) : du diagnostic \u00e0 la pr\u00e9cision th\u00e9rapeutique", "start": "2026-10-11T11:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-11T12:15+02:00", "objectives": ["<p data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"173\"><strong data-end=\"239\" data-start=\"173\">Comprendre l\u2019h\u00e9t\u00e9rog\u00e9n\u00e9it\u00e9 des&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 100, 100); background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);\"><strong>Cancers de Primitif Inconnu (CAPI)&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span><strong data-end=\"239\" data-start=\"173\">et leur impact pronostique</strong><br data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"239\">", "Savoir distinguer les formes favorables des formes d\u00e9favorables, savoir int\u00e9grer les donn\u00e9es \u00e9pid\u00e9miologiques actuelles et sortir d\u2019une vision homog\u00e8ne historiquement associ\u00e9e \u00e0 une chimioth\u00e9rapie empirique.</p>", "<p data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"431\"><strong data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"431\">Structurer le parcours de soins autour des fili\u00e8res sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9es</strong><br data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"499\">", "Identifier le r\u00f4le central de la RCP nationale CUP (cancer of unknown primary)&nbsp;dans la coordination diagnostique, l\u2019acc\u00e8s au Plan France M\u00e9decine G\u00e9nomique et la validation des strat\u00e9gies th\u00e9rapeutiques.</p>", "<p data-end=\"942\" data-start=\"685\"><strong data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"685\">Ma\u00eetriser les apports de la pathologie et de la biologie mol\u00e9culaire</strong><br data-end=\"760\" data-start=\"757\">", "Comprendre les limites de l\u2019immunohistochimie seule et l\u2019int\u00e9r\u00eat du NGS (Next-Generation Sequencing) ADN/ARN pour identifier des alt\u00e9rations mol\u00e9culaires actionnables orientant vers une m\u00e9decine de pr\u00e9cision.</p>", "<p data-end=\"1208\" data-start=\"947\"><strong data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"947\">Optimiser la strat\u00e9gie d\u2019imagerie diagnostique</strong><br data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"997\">", "D\u00e9finir la hi\u00e9rarchie des examens (scanner TAP, TEP-FDG, imagerie cibl\u00e9e) pour cartographier la maladie, sugg\u00e9rer des hypoth\u00e8ses diagnostiques et r\u00e9duire l\u2019errance diagnostique sans retarder le traitement.</p>", "<p data-end=\"1497\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"1213\"><strong data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1213\">Renforcer le r\u00f4le du radiologue et de la radiologie interventionnelle</strong><br data-end=\"1289\" data-start=\"1286\">", "Garantir des pr\u00e9l\u00e8vements de haute qualit\u00e9 adapt\u00e9s aux exigences mol\u00e9culaires actuelles et identifier les situations oligom\u00e9tastatiques susceptibles de b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier de traitements locaux \u00e0 vis\u00e9e pronostique.</p>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "0d424772-aa4d-491e-97e5-d79be067453c", "name": "241", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "0759b564-18f6-4163-a04c-84216fb625ed", "title": "\u00c9pid\u00e9miologie, d\u00e9finitions et organisation des soins", "start": "2026-10-11T11:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-11T11:30+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "0759B564-18F6-4163-A04C-84216FB625ED"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "0c0ff8c6-2c0a-40dc-897c-d3f971b047be", "lastName": "Watson", "firstName": "Sarah", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Paris"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}}, {"id": "993f0e5d-4a07-41fe-95e4-0917a763147b", "title": "Apport de la pathologie, biologie mol\u00e9culaire et axes th\u00e9rapeutiques", "start": "2026-10-11T11:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-11T11:45+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "993F0E5D-4A07-41FE-95E4-0917A763147B"}}, "speakers": {"item